	| Entity Id   | 1z2x3c4v5b6n7m8a9s |
	| Entity Name | project            |
	And the external link with the entity id "67890" and domain "analytics-cloud" should be present on the account "Permis - ${staticProjectName}" with the following values
	| Domain      | analytics-cloud |
	| Entity Id   | 67890           |
	| Entity Name | group           |
	And the external link with the entity id "1z2x3c4v5b6n7m8a9s" and domain "dxp-cloud" should be present on the account "Permis - ${staticProjectName}" with the following values
	| Domain      | dxp-cloud          |
	| Entity Id   | 1z2x3c4v5b6n7m8a9s |
	| Entity Name | project            |
	When I assign the contact with the email address "prm.koroneiki1@lrcustomer.com.broken" on the account "Permis - ${staticProjectName}" to the following roles
	| Support Requester |
	And I create a team with the name "Permission Partner" for the account "Permis - ${staticProjectName}"
	And I assign the team with the name "Permission Partner" on the account "Permis - ${staticProjectName}" to the following roles
	| First Line Support |
	And I log into the provisioning homepage as "provisioning.admin@liferay.com.broken" with password "${staticProvisioningQaUserPassword}"
	And I update my password upon login to "test"
	And I go to the account index page
	And I search the accounts page using the keyword "Permis"
	And I click on the account with the name "Permis - ${staticProjectName}" on the provisioning index
	And I click on the "Details" tab
	And I edit the following account fields and types to the following values under the account details tab
	| Account Name          | Input         | Perpro - ${staticProjectName} | |
	| Code                  | Input         | PERPROPERPRO                  | |
	| Tier                  | Select        | T1                            | |
	| Data Region           | Select        | Hungary                       | |
