	When I go to the account index page
	And I search the accounts page using the keyword "Permis"
	Then I should not be able to view an account on the provisioning index with the name "Permis - ${staticProjectName}"
	And I should be able to view a koroneiki account with the name "Perpro - ${staticProjectName}" and the following values
	| Code        | PERPROPERPRO                  | |
	| Name        | Perpro - ${staticProjectName} | |
	| Region      | United States                 | |
	| Data Region | Hungary                       | |
	| Status      | Active                        | |
	| Tier        | T1                            | |
	And I should not be able to view a koroneiki account with the name "Permis - ${staticProjectName}"
	When I search the accounts page using the keyword "Perpro"
	And I click on the account with the name "Perpro - ${staticProjectName}" on the provisioning index
	And I click on the "Support" tab
	Then I should be able to view the following account values under the account details tab
	| Support Region   | United States | |
	| Support Language | English       | |
	And I click on the "History" tab
	Then the history entry with the keyword "Provisioning Admin > Updated Account" with the field value "name" should be visible on the account details page with the following values
